-                           ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p2 t2_1
-                           ->  Hash
-                                 ->  Seq Scan on prt2_p2 t3_1
-                     ->  Hash Join
-                           Hash Cond: (t2_2.a = t3_2.b)
-                           ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p3 t2_2
-                           ->  Hash
-                                 ->  Seq Scan on prt2_p3 t3_2
