--------------------------------------------------------------
- Append
-   ->  Seq Scan on boolrangep_tf
-         Filter: ((a IS NOT FALSE) AND (NOT b) AND (c = 25))
-   ->  Seq Scan on boolrangep_null
-         Filter: ((a IS NOT FALSE) AND (NOT b) AND (c = 25))
-(5 rows)
