-                     ->  Seq Scan on pagg_tab1_p2 t1_1
-                     ->  Hash
-                           ->  Seq Scan on pagg_tab2_p2 t2_1
-         ->  HashAggregate
-               Group Key: t1_2.x
-               ->  Hash Join
-                     Hash Cond: (t2_2.y = t1_2.x)
-                     ->  Seq Scan on pagg_tab2_p3 t2_2
-                     ->  Hash
-                           ->  Seq Scan on pagg_tab1_p3 t1_2
